{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13224450","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13224450","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1322445001:1":{"text":"너희는... 누구야? 꺼, 꺼져!","source_cn":"你们……是谁？走、走开！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x034F5190D0E13A46","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322445002:1":{"text":"중요한 일이 있어서 이리나를 찾아왔어요!","source_cn":"我们找伊琳娜，有重要的事要和她说！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x004E0330BB32EC6E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322445003:1":{"text":"비, 비켜. 이제 막 나가서 한 잔 하려던 참이라고!","source_cn":"别……挡路，我正要出门、出门喝一杯。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D37E0C86E0F3746","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322445004:1":{"text":"정말 중요한 일이 있단 말이에요!","source_cn":"我们有非常重要的事！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x40CBAAD188187D2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322445005:1":{"text":"쯧, 네 녀석들은 대체 누구야? 왜... 그렇게, 흔들거리는... 건데?","source_cn":"啧，你们是谁啊……怎么……一个劲在、在晃？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x251F877C04C35CCE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1322445006:1":{"text":"저희가 흔들거리다뇨! 당신이 술을 너무 많이 마신 거겠죠!","source_cn":"我们哪有晃啊！是你喝太多了吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44A62C9ECA3E9179","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1322445007:1":{"text":"술을 많이 마셨다고? 그럴 리가... 부족해, 더 마셔야 한다고!","source_cn":"喝太多？哪有……不够，根本不够！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D872E689D23B630","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1322445007":{"text":"술을 많이 마셨다고? 그럴 리가... 부족해, 더 마셔야 한다고!","source_cn":"喝太多？哪有……不够，根本不够！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D872E689D23B630","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1322445008:1":{"text":"그 애는, 딸꾹! 아무도 못 만나. 포기하고 당장 꺼져!","source_cn":"那孩子，嗝！谁也不会见的，省省吧你！走开，快走开！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27F69E4EACCF5EA0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1322445011:1":{"text":"냉큼 꺼져! 술 마시러 가는 데 방해나 하지 말라고... 하하! 술이다, 술!","source_cn":"走开，走开！别耽误我喝酒……哈哈，喝酒！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E9B75AC93E6E8D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1322445011":{"text":"냉큼 꺼져! 술 마시러 가는 데 방해나 하지 말라고... 하하! 술이다, 술!","source_cn":"走开，走开！别耽误我喝酒……哈哈，喝酒！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E9B75AC93E6E8D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1322445012:1":{"text":"귀찮아 죽겠네! 그래, 알았다고! 비켜. 술이나 마시러 갈 거니까.","source_cn":"嘁，真是麻烦！行了行了，我、我知道了。让让，我……要去...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81CC38A6603F092B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1322445016:1":{"text":"당분간 밖에 안 내보내면, 딸꾹! 되는 거지?","source_cn":"让她不要……近期不要出门，嗝！这就行了吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDFAEDAB0B4BA32EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1322445017:1":{"text":"이제 됐으면... 꺼지라고! 방해하지 말란 말이야...","source_cn":"你们，该干什么就……干什么去吧！别来烦老子……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E84420C04553045","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:0:1":{"text":"제발 전해줘","source_cn":"请务必转达","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5631C929FDF7DD74","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"제발 전해줘","female":"제발 전해줘","variant_male_record_index":"70156","variant_female_record_index":"70157","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1322445013:1":{"text":"뭐, 뭘 어떻게 하겠다는 거지?","source_cn":"你……你们要怎样？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA312D657FBAC63B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1322445014:1":{"text":"이건 이리나의 안전이 걸린 문제예요. 당신이 관심 없다면 우리가 손을 쓸 수밖에 없죠. 그게 물리적인 수단이든, 마법의 힘을 빌리든지 말이에요.","source_cn":"事关伊琳娜的人身安全，如果你做不到，我们就只能动用物理...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D617304A6C32145","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1322445015:1":{"text":"윽... 그, 그래. 너희 잘났다! 아, 알았다고...","source_cn":"呃……算、算你厉害……行了，我……知道了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24A6F4AC1D7905B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:1:2":{"text":"우리 말을 안 들으면 후회할 거야...","source_cn":"你要是不听，就别怪我们……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x674FAD49ED9E0B06","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"우리 말을 안 들으면 후회할 거야...","female":"우리 말을 안 들으면 후회할 거야...","variant_male_record_index":"70158","variant_female_record_index":"70159","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:0:1":{"text":"이리나를 만나게 해줘","source_cn":"请带我们见伊琳娜","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xBC258A12B8A8BD30","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"이리나를 만나게 해줘","female":"이리나를 만나게 해줘","variant_male_record_index":"70150","variant_female_record_index":"70151","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1322445009:1":{"text":"꾀어내다니... 뭘? 헛소리하지 마! 그 애가... 딸꾹! 뭘 꾀어낼만한 가치가 있다고.","source_cn":"蛊惑……什么蛊惑？瞎说，她……嗝，她有什么值、值得蛊惑的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91F50502DF96801D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:1:2":{"text":"이교도들이 이리나를 꾀어내고 있어","source_cn":"邪教徒正在蛊惑伊琳娜","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x62A877982FF2A19E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"이교도들이 이리나를 꾀어내고 있어","female":"이교도들이 이리나를 꾀어내고 있어","variant_male_record_index":"70152","variant_female_record_index":"70153","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1322445010:1":{"text":"그게 너랑... 무슨 상관이야! 그 애 애비는 나라고! 네가, 딸꾹! 뭔데 참견이야?","source_cn":"关……关你什么事！我是她老子，你……你算什么，管我的事儿？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF78423F7F856E54F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:2:3":{"text":"이리나를 잘 돌보도록 해","source_cn":"你要好好照顾伊琳娜","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xBC1180DA772ABB88","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"이리나를 잘 돌보도록 해","female":"이리나를 잘 돌보도록 해","variant_male_record_index":"70154","variant_female_record_index":"70155","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:酒鬼德米特里":{"text":"주정뱅이 드미트리","source":"酒鬼德米特里","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":25,"localized_text_count":24,"speaker_count":3}}